sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Cliente
  participant W as Web
  participant A as API de Pedidos
  participant E as Estoque
  participant P as Pagamento
  U->>W: finalizar compra
  W->>A: POST /pedidos
  A->>E: reservar(itens)
  E-->>A: ok
  A->>P: cobrar(valor)
  alt aprovado
    P-->>A: aprovado
    A-->>W: 201 Created
  else recusado
    P-->>A: recusado
    A->>E: liberar(itens)
    A-->>W: 402 Payment Required
  end
